{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13207120","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13207120","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1320712001:0":{"text":"おお、来てくれたのか！グブリンに柵を壊されない方法があると君の仲間たちから聞いて、ずっと待ってたんだよ。","source_cn":"哦，你可算来了！你的族人说有办法解决咕布林破坏栅栏的问...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x373F96DDA1188635","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320712002:1":{"text":"まったく、口の軽い奴らだ。ついこの前思いついたばかりなのに、もうヨハンから聞いたのか？","source_cn":"那帮家伙的嘴挺快啊，我才想出新点子，老约恩这就告诉你了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC17DB825E5807C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320712003:1":{"text":"まあいい、見てろ、今すぐアイアンファングに会わせてやる。","source_cn":"我马上请小铁牙出来，你们瞧好吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCB50BB6B83E05B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320712004:1":{"text":"アイアンファング？それは誰です？","source_cn":"小铁牙？小铁牙是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DF6C0D447591C2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320712005:1":{"text":"ワシが作った防護柵さ。","source_cn":"是我做的防护栅栏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1734320146FAB237","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320712006:1":{"text":"あー……なるほど。素敵な名前ですねえ。","source_cn":"这……好吧，你给它取了个好名字呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0F953FA67ED12A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320712007:1":{"text":"だろう！アイアンファングがいればグブリンなんて怖くない！こいつは、この町の治安を守る頼もしい仲間になるぞ！","source_cn":"那可不！要是小铁牙能彻底阻止咕布林，它以后也能为雪松镇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33CEA61B77D3BE9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320712008:1":{"text":"ただ、取り付けるのにちとばかし時間が必要だ。まあ、少し待ってろ、明日の朝までには完成できる。","source_cn":"安装小铁牙需要点时间，你们等等吧，不会太久的，明早天亮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A90746A144DC9F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320712009:1":{"text":"明日の朝！？","source_cn":"这也太久了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02412EEE25E8D5E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320712010:1":{"text":"なんだ？他に用事でもあるのか？","source_cn":"咋啦？你们还有事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBAF1D00732FB638","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1320712010":{"text":"なんだ？他に用事でもあるのか？","source_cn":"咋啦？你们还有事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBAF1D00732FB638","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320712011:1":{"text":"何だ？急を要する用事なのか？","source_cn":"什么事？要紧不？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF0E569FFAD9E0D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320712012:1":{"text":"そうでもないですが、今、故郷の人たちに送るお土産を選んでるんです。","source_cn":"倒不是什么要紧事，我在帮家人们挑礼物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE824558A8985C333","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320712013:1":{"text":"でも、まだ旅館の仕事が残ってるので、あまり時間をかけられなくて……","source_cn":"可我不能在外头耽误太久，旅馆那边还有活儿等着我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA03A24BAFA35F2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320712015:1":{"text":"この町の名産品、<style=\"highlight\">アロマコハダの缶詰</style>なら、土産にもってこいだぞ！","source_cn":"说到礼物，千万不能错过镇子上的名产——<style=h...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9268B71A32C4B8B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320712016:1":{"text":"酒のつまみで、あれ以上の物はない！この町一番だと自信を持って言える！","source_cn":"雪松镇再也找不到比它更带劲的下酒菜了，相信我，你们一定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBC9BE7D6EED9544","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320712017:1":{"text":"お酒のつまみ……アルドンじいちゃんとダウナエばあちゃんが好きそうですね。それはどこで買えるんです？","source_cn":"下酒菜啊……雅顿老师和达赫妮婆婆应该会喜欢。哪里能买到？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFC8B7413CF412A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1320712018:1":{"text":"町のレストランだ。よく行く店だから、ワシの名前を出せば店主さんが割引してくれるかもな！","source_cn":"镇上我常去的那家餐馆就能买到。报我的名字，兴许老板娘还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9060D7E77343086C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1320712019:1":{"text":"おお、早速行ってみます！ありがとうございます！","source_cn":"我们马上去，谢啦老兄。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7E364BC113FA2A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1320712020:1":{"text":"行きましょう、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さん。","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4FE7CC7D5A123164","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"行きましょう、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さん。","female":"行きましょう、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さん。","variant_male_record_index":"148371","variant_female_record_index":"148372","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:0:1":{"text":"ああ、そうだ。","source_cn":"嗯，是有点事",